<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Centre of Excellence, {!IndividualApplication.COE_Name__c},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for submitting your application titled “<b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>”.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">After careful evaluation, we regret to inform you that the application has <b>not been shortlisted for presentation</b> before the Selection Committee.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We truly appreciate the effort and thought invested in your proposal. While this application was not selected at this stage, we encourage you to continue refining your ideas and consider applying in future opportunities.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We value your association with the Wadhwani Foundation and look forward to your continued participation.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sincerely,</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>Wadhwani Foundation</b></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>